{
  "name": "07 - Monitor de vagas",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 6
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "93b8b833-987b-59c3-a6e0-0e34fe77e4a2",
      "name": "A cada 6 horas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b4a16e9c-02f3-5995-8f12-0be237a09f47",
              "name": "palavras_chave",
              "value": "[\"python\", \"n8n\", \"automação\", \"automation\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "22ef5353-8f03-5945-90f7-9e656ef21f8b",
              "name": "feeds",
              "value": "[\n  {\n    \"nome\": \"We Work Remotely\",\n    \"url\": \"https://weworkremotely.com/categories/remote-programming-jobs.rss\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"nome\": \"Meu feed\",\n    \"url\": \"SEU_FEED_RSS\"\n  }\n]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "d343b627-f8d7-54a1-be48-f2895a920c2b",
              "name": "busca_remotive",
              "value": "python",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c8885bab-b4b9-540e-ba7b-5b8a6e36c162",
              "name": "chat_id",
              "value": "SEU_CHAT_ID",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b77c8817-9c74-5d29-b772-e805861260d5",
              "name": "max_por_alerta",
              "value": 15,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c5de8c99-2910-58a6-b6ad-029be0ce642c",
      "name": "Configuração",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "feeds",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a6269c22-3da4-5a23-8740-6cf55dec77b1",
      "name": "Separar feeds",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "70232f9f-83c9-5981-ace5-fcfc47a5b558",
      "name": "Ler feed de vagas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.rssFeedRead",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        680,
        240
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "94bf39c5-8e29-55cd-a9c5-f42b286cb4ef",
              "name": "id",
              "value": "={{ $json.guid || $json.link || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f6b94442-ae97-5f39-9239-aca2662e90eb",
              "name": "titulo",
              "value": "={{ ($json.title ?? '').trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "be229ccc-65b2-59e4-ac3f-256397163c14",
              "name": "empresa",
              "value": "={{ $json.creator ?? $json.author ?? '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ead41268-7460-5c88-9efc-d59ae7aa6b65",
              "name": "local",
              "value": "",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "91242493-7f7d-5086-b643-50e71f98c50a",
              "name": "link",
              "value": "={{ $json.link ?? '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "57bbbb5d-ebc9-5d88-a96e-b8ad2703dfc6",
              "name": "descricao",
              "value": "={{ ($json.contentSnippet ?? '').slice(0, 2000) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "e702c2ab-a22b-5058-b7a0-3f58ccdfba4d",
              "name": "fonte",
              "value": "={{ $('Separar feeds').item.json.nome }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a522baca-1519-55b0-90e6-6643fdaee1fa",
      "name": "Normalizar RSS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        900,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://remotive.com/api/remote-jobs",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "search",
              "value": "={{ $json.busca_remotive }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "value": "50"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "7bbc43ef-29b3-5e67-bad0-3331091036f2",
      "name": "Buscar na Remotive",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        460,
        560
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "jobs",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7f9b9128-6980-5d40-a908-814ab3b27167",
      "name": "Separar vagas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        560
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "4bb94277-2c10-5851-8f0f-b960f3ac9606",
              "name": "id",
              "value": "={{ $json.id ? 'remotive-' + $json.id : '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b0043812-0fd1-5d06-b2ce-32ae2bdec6d4",
              "name": "titulo",
              "value": "={{ $json.title ?? '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ea4d8dd7-3185-59f2-948b-5556e970ca83",
              "name": "empresa",
              "value": "={{ $json.company_name ?? '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "ab73c5f9-57c3-5479-a72d-d02a9284af8d",
              "name": "local",
              "value": "={{ $json.candidate_required_location ?? '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "907de072-9be7-58fd-9aaf-d183895c83a7",
              "name": "link",
              "value": "={{ $json.url ?? '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "85b91f51-ce63-570b-b81f-a2de21ae5aab",
              "name": "descricao",
              "value": "={{ ($json.description ?? '').replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ').slice(0, 2000) }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cf3c7433-c644-58fe-8ec7-65facd80e27e",
              "name": "fonte",
              "value": "Remotive",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "69cac1de-833d-520a-8a39-4015dc4c9760",
      "name": "Normalizar Remotive",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        900,
        560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "0725a597-6766-5219-82c9-8755afd4fc5d",
      "name": "Juntar fontes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1140,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "b23ae1cf-81ac-52d8-8fbb-23383846fa44",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "rightValue": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "9aa5be1e-e218-5289-9d29-10a589884dea",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.palavras_chave.some(p => ($json.titulo + ' ' + $json.descricao).toLowerCase().includes(p.toLowerCase())) }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "51b839fe-11bc-5088-8ae6-82fd560f49af",
      "name": "Tem palavra-chave?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1360,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "removeDuplicateInputItems",
        "compare": "selectedFields",
        "fieldsToCompare": "id",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2d0cdfc6-96bd-5ce2-ba25-1c0ae788127a",
      "name": "Remover repetidas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1580,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "removeItemsWithAlreadySeenKeyValues",
        "dedupeValue": "={{ $json.id }}",
        "options": {
          "scope": "workflow",
          "historySize": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "656019de-2d06-573c-a3f3-e4ac50c0f871",
      "name": "Só vagas nunca vistas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1800,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "maxItems": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.max_por_alerta }}"
      },
      "id": "ff7a63ec-e00f-537a-b818-bfe7e00c1098",
      "name": "Limitar alerta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.limit",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2020,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "0985fb10-ebec-5953-90fa-1eab02862a4c",
              "name": "linha",
              "value": "={{ (() => {\n  const e = (s) => String(s ?? '').replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;').replace(/\"/g, '&quot;');\n  const extra = [$json.empresa, $json.local].filter(Boolean).map(e).join(' · ');\n  return `💼 <b>${e($json.titulo)}</b>` + (extra ? `\\n🏢 ${extra}` : '') + `\\n🔗 <a href=\"${e($json.link)}\">ver vaga</a> (${e($json.fonte)})`;\n})() }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "55fc0797-4e5d-5568-8ea0-bc1bc62c57e3",
      "name": "Formatar vaga",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        2240,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldsToAggregate": {
          "fieldToAggregate": [
            {
              "fieldToAggregate": "linha"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cf9bf4a4-bd13-5169-ad73-dccf9450044b",
      "name": "Juntar vagas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2460,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "=🔔 <b>{{ $json.linha.length }} vaga(s) nova(s)</b>\n\n{{ $json.linha.join('\\n\\n') }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "parse_mode": "HTML",
          "disable_web_page_preview": true
        }
      },
      "id": "9f50bed5-da84-5dce-81c1-8f9b1fce8e15",
      "name": "Enviar vagas novas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        2680,
        400
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "credencial-telegram",
          "name": "Telegram Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔎 Monitor de vagas\nA cada 6h busca vagas em feeds RSS e na API pública da Remotive, filtra por palavras-chave e avisa **só as novas** no Telegram.\n\n**Configure no nó _Configuração_:**\n- `palavras_chave`\n- `feeds` (troque `SEU_FEED_RSS`)\n- `busca_remotive`\n- `chat_id` (`SEU_CHAT_ID`)",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "2760273b-1acc-5bc6-b21c-bb42e2ce2252",
      "name": "Nota 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 📡 Fontes\nRSS (qualquer site/agregador que tenha feed) + HTTP Request para a Remotive. Falhas em uma fonte não param as outras.",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 680
      },
      "id": "0c56ac4a-ca56-5b9b-8f80-dd7cb3042f19",
      "name": "Nota 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        420,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧠 Memória de vagas vistas\n_Remove Duplicates_ no modo **\"processados em execuções anteriores\"** guarda os IDs dentro do próprio n8n (escopo do workflow, até 10 mil IDs). Nenhuma vaga é avisada duas vezes.\n\nNa 1ª execução, tudo é novo: o alerta é limitado a `max_por_alerta`.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 1000
      },
      "id": "3a1b1699-a927-5f94-b424-2379396c7dbe",
      "name": "Nota 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 📲 Alerta\nUma mensagem só com todas as vagas novas.\n\nCredencial: **Telegram Bot**",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 620
      },
      "id": "e51535e9-6756-52f5-9fa0-dfe1b5ca0d3f",
      "name": "Nota 4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2180,
        20
      ]
    }
  ],
